# Bench/eval kernel-output pulls: same class as runs/kernel_pulls/ above (line 83).
# 2026-08-31: runs/bench_pull_0831 was 98 MB (27 MB pkl + ~70 MB of *_events.jsonl).
# Same principle — track the PROVENANCE, not the BYTES: the verdict and its
# numbers live in ITERATION_LOG.md and learnings/war_room/, and the artifact is
# re-pullable from Kaggle with `kaggle kernels output`.
arc-prize-2026/runs/bench_pull_*/

# SQLite WAL/shm sidecars — transient, recreated on open, and they conflict.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
